    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Unknown_Regions\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Unknown Regions\">Star Wars Saga Edition Unknown Regions</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You are able to counter <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grab\" title=\"Grab\">Grab</a> and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grapple\" title=\"Grapple\">Grapple</a> attacks, redirecting them back on your attacker.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> 13</p><p><b>Effect:</b> You gain a +2 bonus to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a> against <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grab\" title=\"Grab\">Grab</a> and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grapple\" title=\"Grapple\">Grapple</a> attacks. If an enemy misses you when making a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grab\" title=\"Grab\">Grab</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grapple\" title=\"Grapple\">Grapple</a> attack, you can immediately make your own <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grab\" title=\"Grab\">Grab</a> attack against the same enemy as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reaction</a>.</p><p><b>Special:</b> If you have a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">Feat</a> that enables you to make a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grapple\" title=\"Grapple\">Grapple</a> attack (such as <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Pin\" title=\"Pin\">Pin</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Trip\" title=\"Trip\">Trip</a>), you can make a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grapple\" title=\"Grapple\">Grapple</a> attack instead.</p>",
